Title=Wallpapers by artists
Body=NCZ-OS includes wallpaper sets from the artists behind it: NCZ, NCZ-OS 26.10 Cygnus, Alex Jay Brady and Brandon Perlow. Pick one in Settings, or let the desktop change it for you every ten minutes. The lock and login screens follow the same wallpaper.
Scene=settings
